---
description: Prefer add or insert over the word create
alwaysApply: true
---

# Wording

Do not use the word "create" in method names, class names, comments, UI copy, README, docs, or commit messages.

Use `add` or `insert` instead.

```java
// Bad
void createIndex() {}

// Good
void addIndex() {}
```

Framework APIs that require that word may stay, for example `Files.createDirectories` and `document.createElement`.
